    "limitations": [
      "Planungsraum-level ordinal classes from the Umweltgerechtigkeitsatlas 2023/2024 (SenMVKU 2025); historical/modelled neighbourhood indicators, not live data, not address-level measurements, not individual health predictions or exposure of a specific premises.",
      "Classes are relative to the Berlin distribution (quartiles for noise and air, equal intervals for thermal), not legal limit values; ranks are ordinal — do not average, sum or treat them as interval measurements.",
      "Reference periods differ per indicator: noise 2022 (Strategische Lärmkarten), air 2023 (annual means), thermal 2022 (Klimamodell), green 2020 (Versorgungsanalyse), social MSS 2023, population density 31.12.2023, residential location Mietspiegel 2024.",
      "Noise/air/thermal/green are model- or interpolation-based estimates; social disadvantage is a register-based index (PLRs with < 300 residents excluded, shown as missing); \"Gebiete ohne Zuordnung\" (null) stays missing.",
      "Green-space provision measures availability of public green per resident only, not green quality or private gardens.",
      "Population class: official legend says \"Einwohnerdichte in EW/km²\", method text says residents count; class label kept verbatim.",
      "simple_residential_location_hint null means \"not flagged or unknown\"; it is not asserted as \"not flagged\".",
      "The official maps mask \"weitgehend unbewohnte Flächen\"; the WFS polygons are full PLRs without this mask.",
      "Environmental indicators are context only and are not part of any opportunity score; any later scoring transformation must be documented separately.",
      "Source access, license (DL-DE-Zero-2.0), layer schema, class values and cross-layer consistency checked 2026-10-18."
